# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large artifacts that `COPY .` (docker/Dockerfile.with-source) would otherwise
# pull into the dev/test image but which nothing there builds or runs. These are
# the biggest build-context contributors (~3.1 GB uncompressed). Scoped to the
# repo-root context only: the TRT-LLM *base* image builds from the submodule's
# own context (its own .dockerignore), and no repo-root build compiles TRT-LLM
# (docker/Dockerfile installs the prebuilt tensorrt_llm wheel), so excluding the
# TRT-LLM sources here is safe.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Release-bundle model checkpoints (~0.7 GB git-LFS). The pytest job NGC-downloads
# its own checkpoints and no Dockerfile COPYs docs/ (the release-bundle assembly
# runs on the CI checkout, not in the image), so none of this is needed here.
docs/

# TensorRT-LLM submodule: the C++/CUDA extension uses only cpp/cmake
# (CMAKE_MODULE_PATH) and compiles from nv_deps/TensorRT-LLM — never the submodule
# sources. Drop the ~2.4 GB of git-LFS FMHA kernel cubins and other unused trees.
3rdparty/TensorRT-LLM/cpp/tensorrt_llm/kernels/
3rdparty/TensorRT-LLM/docs/
3rdparty/TensorRT-LLM/tests/
3rdparty/TensorRT-LLM/examples/
3rdparty/TensorRT-LLM/benchmarks/
3rdparty/TensorRT-LLM/triton_backend/

# cutlass is header-only here (cpp/cmake/deps/cutlass.cmake uses include/ + tools/util/include).
3rdparty/cutlass/docs/
3rdparty/cutlass/media/
3rdparty/cutlass/test/
3rdparty/cutlass/examples/
3rdparty/cutlass/python/

# openfold-3: only the openfold3/ python package is imported by tests.
3rdparty/openfold-3/assets/
3rdparty/openfold-3/docs/
